flowchart TD
  Concept[Accepted measured 2D warehouse concept] --> Model[Artist: separately versioned rack and removable metal cassettes]
  Model --> QA[Actual geometry: contacts, caps, locks, neighboring envelopes and static export QA]
  QA --> Candidate[Static delivery candidate; no runtime or all-cell acceptance]
  Candidate --> RackView[Current static integration: crate-rack model selected by WarehouseView]
  RackView --> Collision[Cached static mesh collision preserves actual rail opening and tray]
  Collision --> Direct[Brief native import / opening / neighboring rail / intact tray check]
  CassetteAssets[Separate cassette assets imported only; preparation/state connection pending] -.-> Candidate
  subgraph Planned_runtime_not_implemented
    Promise[WarehouseService: one finite cell promise] --> Compatible{Correct physical support and actual access ready?}
    Compatible -->|no| Prepare[Real worker prepares or changes item-specific support at empty cell]
    Prepare --> Event[Preparation completion / actual access event]
    Event --> Compatible
    Compatible -->|yes| Handoff[Receiving: actual reached handling activity]
    Handoff --> Stock[Ledger: one actual stock deposit]
    Stock --> Commit[WarehouseService: consume one cell promise]
  end
  Candidate -. prospective integration after measured handling .-> Compatible
  Ordinary[Ordinary cargo: original planes and complete envelopes] -. preserve .-> Promise
  Timber[Frozen timber fixtures and animations: separate approval scope] -. unchanged .-> Concept
